By Technology Stack
•	Managed SQL – Microsoft Azure SQL Database, AWS Aurora, Google Cloud Spanner, Oracle Autonomous Database.
•	Managed NoSQL – MongoDB Atlas, Amazon DynamoDB, Azure Cosmos DB.
